    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous item</em></p>\n<p>These thin leather gloves have red stitching that appears to shimmer softly as the fingers of the glove move. If you are proficient in <em>Gestural </em>and sign using these gloves, the gloves translate the gestures into <em>Common</em>. This 'speech' retains the intended emphasis, volume, and tone of your signing.</p>\n<p>You may use this 'speech' as the verbal component for your spellcasting.</p>\n<p>These gloves emit a faint aura of Illusion.</p>",
